; Process.4's example: a hook's report and a transcript's watch. Each process
; is named for what it is born of, a Report call and a Watch record; then the
; configured values moved into it at its birth, what it gives, and what it ends
; in. Until ethos-zero reads a Nexus's roots together, a Process generates the
; types its outcomes carry, and its Process, Gift, Taken and Outcome are
; written by hand.
Process
[ claude_harness:signal:[ Report Reported Changed ]
  claude_harness:memory:[ Watch Observe RowCount ]
  claude_harness:emission:[ Follow ] ]
[ Report.{ []
           [ Reported Watch Observe Changed ]
           Reporting }
  Watch.{ [ RowCount ]
          [ Follow Observe Changed ]
          Watching }
  Subscribe.{ []
              [ Changed ] } ]
[ Subscribe.{}
  Reporting.[ Observed Unremembered ]
  Watching.[ Forgotten Unfollowed ] ]
